From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:43:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: Publish-path profile counters (timeline=2)

Cumulative CNTVCT ticks and call counts for submit_render/compute,
prepare_render/compute, firmware live writes and reads, firmware and VM
syncs, write_low, the doorbell flush and the whole pump pass, read as
text from debugfs asahi_m4/publish_profile. Dota publishes undeferred
submissions at a flat 25 us per Work (d152-2); this attributes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
